" Go to previous tab page or move current tab page to position specified by the
" Count
nnoremap <silent> gT : <C-u>
                    \| if v:count == 0
                    \|     execute 'normal gT'
                    \| elseif v:count > tabpagenr('$')
                    \|     tabmove
                    \| elseif v:count >= tabpagenr()
                    \|     execute 'tabmove' v:count
                    \| elseif v:count < tabpagenr()
                    \|     execute 'tabmove' v:count - 1
                    \| endif
                    \| <cr>

